  "+- **DEGENERATE** — a witness that satisfies the premise structure only at a parameter where the structure says nothing, such as a zero base or an empty range, and is therefore not counted as a witness *(the author's ruling (R253)(5)(b); relay data/b642_nonvacuity.txt)*",
